<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Blog</title><description>张亚的博客.</description><link>https://https/zyv037.github.io</link><item><title>电影《黑水Dark water》</title><link>https://https/posts/%E7%94%B5%E5%BD%B1%E9%BB%91%E6%B0%B4dark-water/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E7%94%B5%E5%BD%B1%E9%BB%91%E6%B0%B4dark-water/</guid><description>美国人讨厌律师是众所周知的。美国人的政治家甚至总统，开国元勋很多人都是律师。律师是法制体系中不可或缺的。</description><pubDate>Sun, 01 Mar 2020 22:24:52 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>deploy</title><link>https://https/posts/deploy/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/deploy/</guid><description>github主页从19年7月之后就没有更新了。电脑从256G 固态升级到了 512G，hexo的环境需要重新安装。</description><pubDate>Sun, 01 Mar 2020 22:10:02 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>图解《双旗镇刀客》</title><link>https://https/posts/%E5%9B%BE%E8%A7%A3%E5%8F%8C%E6%97%97%E9%95%87%E5%88%80%E5%AE%A2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E5%9B%BE%E8%A7%A3%E5%8F%8C%E6%97%97%E9%95%87%E5%88%80%E5%AE%A2/</guid><description>电影拍摄于1990年,我出生的年份。模糊的影像中,可以清晰看到人性。这是一个传说中的小故事,发生在过去的中国西北。</description><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jul 2019 02:01:20 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>图解《巴斯特·斯克鲁格斯的歌谣》之吵闹的小皮尔斯总统</title><link>https://https/posts/%E5%9B%BE%E8%A7%A3%E5%B7%B4%E6%96%AF%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B%E9%B2%81%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%8C%E8%B0%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%B5%E9%97%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%AE%E5%B0%94%E6%96%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%9F/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E5%9B%BE%E8%A7%A3%E5%B7%B4%E6%96%AF%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E5%85%8B%E9%B2%81%E6%A0%BC%E6%96%AF%E7%9A%84%E6%AD%8C%E8%B0%A3%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%B5%E9%97%B9%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%AE%E5%B0%94%E6%96%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%9F/</guid><description>电影由6个美国西部故事组成的。这个故事大概30分钟。一开始还很温暖的，谁知道最后悲剧收场了。科恩兄弟导演。</description><pubDate>Thu, 11 Jul 2019 21:23:28 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>奇迹热气球</title><link>https://https/posts/%E5%A5%87%E8%BF%B9%E7%83%AD%E6%B0%94%E7%90%83/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E5%A5%87%E8%BF%B9%E7%83%AD%E6%B0%94%E7%90%83/</guid><description>如果我在东德拥有花园房子，爱妻，儿女，我会奋不顾这一切的去西德么？Freedom，怎不叫人欣喜若狂。</description><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jul 2019 20:45:58 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>《金刚不坏》《老笠》《极恶非道》《摄影机不要停》</title><link>https://https/posts/%E9%87%91%E5%88%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%9D%8F%E8%80%81%E7%AC%A0%E6%9E%81%E6%81%B6%E9%9D%9E%E9%81%93%E6%91%84%E5%BD%B1%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E5%81%9C/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E9%87%91%E5%88%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%9D%8F%E8%80%81%E7%AC%A0%E6%9E%81%E6%81%B6%E9%9D%9E%E9%81%93%E6%91%84%E5%BD%B1%E6%9C%BA%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E5%81%9C/</guid><description>昆丁的《金刚不坏》坏人够坏 好人够狠。北野武的《极恶非道》剧情随意，没有主线，不清晰，而且不真实。</description><pubDate>Sat, 06 Jul 2019 22:42:25 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>撞死了一只羊</title><link>https://https/posts/%E6%92%9E%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%AA%E7%BE%8A/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E6%92%9E%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%AA%E7%BE%8A/</guid><description>没什么，一场梦。叙事的技巧不错，许多细节值得一思。电影就是讲故事。</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2019 21:35:52 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>人类登月运载火箭土星5号全图解</title><link>https://https/posts/%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E7%99%BB%E6%9C%88%E8%BF%90%E8%BD%BD%E7%81%AB%E7%AE%AD%E5%9C%9F%E6%98%9F5%E5%8F%B7%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BE%E8%A7%A3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E7%99%BB%E6%9C%88%E8%BF%90%E8%BD%BD%E7%81%AB%E7%AE%AD%E5%9C%9F%E6%98%9F5%E5%8F%B7%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BE%E8%A7%A3/</guid><description>登月运载火箭土星5号全图解全网首发啦。花了一周时间翻译，2000x4094像素，图片较大，建议电脑上看。</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Jun 2019 02:20:10 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>libuv build under windows vs2015</title><link>https://https/posts/libuv-build/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/libuv-build/</guid><description>download source libuv source, install python2.7,vs2015,git. run vcbuild.bat, open uv.sln, set windows SDK version &amp; platform toolset.</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Jun 2019 21:17:36 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>姑奶奶</title><link>https://https/posts/%E5%A7%91%E5%A5%B6%E5%A5%B6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E5%A7%91%E5%A5%B6%E5%A5%B6/</guid><description>这样的人活了快三十了，才知道自己要玩什么。说话特别的有感染力，普通话很标准，用词生动。幽默，又有点道理。</description><pubDate>Mon, 10 Jun 2019 22:56:27 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>金钱世家</title><link>https://https/posts/%E9%87%91%E9%92%B1%E4%B8%96%E5%AE%B6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E9%87%91%E9%92%B1%E4%B8%96%E5%AE%B6/</guid><description>片子太柔和，剧情不够跌宕，没有高潮。也未能反映一些深层次的rich man的人性之类的。人物描述太过零散，没有突出的人物。</description><pubDate>Sun, 26 May 2019 16:15:58 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>volume_rendering点云绘制</title><link>https://https/posts/volume_rendering%E7%82%B9%E4%BA%91%E7%BB%98%E5%88%B6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/volume_rendering%E7%82%B9%E4%BA%91%E7%BB%98%E5%88%B6/</guid><description>Volume Rendering use QCustom3DVolume 3D texture/Point Cloud Drawing. The Transfer Color Edit Dialog public QColorDialog.</description><pubDate>Fri, 17 May 2019 17:16:26 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>talk with a girl</title><link>https://https/posts/talk-with-a-girl/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/talk-with-a-girl/</guid><description>与一个女孩聊天，有聊在哪里呢？到最后，女人对我来说才是最重要的呢。&quot;要奋斗 要追求 要发现 绝不认输&quot;</description><pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2019 20:53:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>小感 有进</title><link>https://https/posts/%E5%B0%8F%E6%84%9F-%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%9B/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/%E5%B0%8F%E6%84%9F-%E6%9C%89%E8%BF%9B/</guid><description>通过此事，我认为，在掌握主动权的情况下，因该谈好具体金额并落实到合同上方可付款。进无止境。事情可以而且应当做的更好。</description><pubDate>Tue, 07 May 2019 18:53:42 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Hexo Config</title><link>https://https/posts/hexo-config/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://https/posts/hexo-config/</guid><description>Post分割线加长：themes\next\source\css\_common\components\post\post-efo.styl .posts-expand .post-eof width。增加Categories链接不生效。</description><pubDate>Wed, 01 May 2019 18:23:18 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>希斯特